{"crc":"d8868955","kind":"Candidate","payload":{"response":"Looking at the issue, the problem is in `_collect_factor_and_dimension` in the Add case. When adding quantities, it checks if dimensions are exactly equal (`dim != addend_dim`), but it should check if they are equivalent dimensions (i.e., they represent the same physical dimension even if expressed differently, like `velocity` vs `acceleration*time`).\n\nThe fix should use the dimension system to check if the dimensions are equivalent rather than just checking for exact equality.\n\n# path: sympy/physics/units/unitsystem.py\n<<<<<<< SEARCH\n        elif isinstance(expr, Add):\n            factor, dim = self._collect_factor_and_dimension(expr.args[0])\n            for addend in expr.args[1:]:\n                addend_factor, addend_dim = \\\n                    self._collect_factor_and_dimension(addend)\n                if dim != addend_dim:\n                    raise ValueError(\n                        'Dimension of \"{}\" is {}, '\n                        'but it should be {}'.format(\n                            addend, addend_dim, dim))\n                factor += addend_factor\n            return factor, dim\n=======\n        elif isinstance(expr, Add):\n            factor, dim = self._collect_factor_and_dimension(expr.args[0])\n            for addend in expr.args[1:]:\n                addend_factor, addend_dim = \\\n                    self._collect_factor_and_dimension(addend)\n                if self.get_dimension_system().get_dimensional_dependencies(dim) != self.get_dimension_system().get_dimensional_dependencies(addend_dim):\n                    raise ValueError(\n                        'Dimension of \"{}\" is {}, '\n                        'but it should be {}'.format(\n                            addend, addend_dim, dim))\n                factor += addend_factor\n            return factor, dim\n>>>>>>> REPLACE","round":1,"slot":0},"producer":{"instance":"01KZQB1NKFJNNFVR2EP983GYZ7","kind":"drafter","parent":"01KZQB1NKABE8PDAJBVDA9HN5F"},"schema":"Candidate@1","seq":14,"t":1786415996.726439}
